OL,3,GNEWSABring your own booze policy saved
OL,4,Amy club, says owner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nightclub owner said their idea to
OL,7,Fallow customers to bring their own
OL,8,Falcohol has saved the venue from
OL,9,Fclosing.
OL,11,FThe XLR nightspot in Withington,
OL,12,FManchester, brought in the unusual
OL,13,Fpolicy a year ago.
OL,15,FOwner Chris Hindle said it gave the
OL,16,Fclub a "real boost" with more people
OL,17,Fcoming through the doors during what
OL,18,Fhas been a tough financial climate in
OL,19,Fthe hospitality sector.
